# Polaris Key pre-commit gate (husky v9).
# Kept deliberately lightweight: only the two fast-failing, cheap guards that catch the
# most common "broke the contract" mistakes locally before a commit lands. The full
# five-language matrix (Python/Swift suites, admin build, format) runs in CI, not here.
#
#   1. conformance drift — the signed corpus must regenerate in place (no wire drift).
#   2. typecheck         — every TS package still type-checks.
#
# Escape hatch: `git commit --no-verify` skips this for trivial/docs-only commits.

pnpm gen:corpus -- --check
pnpm typecheck
